  _tips:
  - "\U0001F4A1 M\u1EB9o: N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p tr\u1EA1m m\u1ECF s\u1EBD gi\xFAp t\u0103ng m\u1EA1nh gi\xE1 b\xE1n qu\u1EB7ng v\xE0 t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 khai th\xE1c!"
  - "\U0001F4A1 M\u1EB9o: Thu\xEA th\xEAm Th\u1EE3 V\u1EADn Chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xE1ch h\xE0ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i l\xE2u."
  - "\U0001F4A1 M\u1EB9o: B\xE0n ngo\xE0i tr\u1EDDi gi\xFAp t\u0103ng th\xEAm kh\xF4ng gian ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 nhi\u1EC1u kh\xE1ch c\xF9ng l\xFAc."
  - "\U0001F4A1 M\u1EB9o: \u0110\u1EEBng qu\xEAn nh\u1EADn ti\u1EC1n th\u01B0\u1EDFng t\xEDch l\u0169y AFK m\u1ED7i khi quay tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i game!"
  - "\U0001F4A1 M\u1EB9o: C\xE2y n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p Ng\u1ECDc L\u1EE5c B\u1EA3o (EUGT) mang l\u1EA1i c\xE1c b\u1ED5 tr\u1EE3 v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 c\xE1c b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3."
